{"matched":39,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0427c01","n":"0427c","t":"次隨解釋此即初也就解釋中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0428a01","n":"0428a","t":"舉觸為依如前第三云瑜伽何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0428b01","n":"0428b","t":"青非非青所緣及處以來分齊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0428c01","n":"0428c","t":"欲為精進依即入佛法次第依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0429a01","n":"0429a","t":"離中皆得起欲故論但言求合"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0429b01","n":"0429b","t":"說欲所起一切事業由欲為彼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0429c01","n":"0429c","t":"境能緣者即是勝解故遍行攝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0430a01","n":"0430a","t":"彼體緣真如等名緣彼類名等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0430b01","n":"0430b","t":"已熏功能在本識中足為後時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0430c01","n":"0430c","t":"遍者理亦不然此觸用故觸能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0431a01","n":"0431a","t":"等念惠等法彼體是思然非即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0431b01","n":"0431b","t":"此欲等五若一起時必有餘四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0431c01","n":"0431c","t":"但學緣眉間等住心於此時中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0432a01","n":"0432a","t":"起解念以決定所觀合起解定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0432c01","n":"0432c","t":"若上意識增上希望未來境等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0433a01","n":"0433a","t":"等引三摩地此云等持三摩鉢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0433c01","n":"0433c","t":"行別故善中加行生得緣世無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0434a01","n":"0434a","t":"申正義中初略後廣略中體業"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0434b01","n":"0434b","t":"得等言上來已解信所依訖隨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0434c01","n":"0434c","t":"信能淨心等依依士釋又慚等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0435a01","n":"0435a","t":"之誰有聖者愛樂苦集故苦集"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0435b01","n":"0435b","t":"故崇賢重善羞恥過惡謂作是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0435c01","n":"0435c","t":"難謂彼若言由待自他境差別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0436a01","n":"0436a","t":"前所言亦有不緣自他境別但"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0436b01","n":"0436b","t":"二初解無貪瞋後解無癡初中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0436c01","n":"0436c","t":"問若體即是別境惠者何須善"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0437b01","n":"0437b","t":"實故三是世俗皆是假有此亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0438a01","n":"0438a","t":"等並爾即六度皆有也述曰自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0438c01","n":"0438c","t":"待餘法即能防修彼四亦然故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0439a01","n":"0439a","t":"亦一切法對法云由捨相應離"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0440a01","n":"0440a","t":"正翻無瞋一分彼所治者瞋之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0440b01","n":"0440b","t":"然對法解慢不敬苦生為業即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0440c01","n":"0440c","t":"有行相體性皆相翻不忿等是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0441a01","n":"0441a","t":"若爾癡分忘念等三何故不翻"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0441b01","n":"0441b","t":"通六識如害翻為不害是或有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0441c01","n":"0441c","t":"等悲愍有情時有不害故以正"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0442a01","n":"0442a","t":"言散心無此輕安非遍誰謂無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0442b01","n":"0442b","t":"初以理證輕安調暢要除麁重"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0443b01","n":"0443b","t":"順學等故如對法第三五十八"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷006a","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":115,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}